{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"chengguo-e-o080a","title":"程昱说靳允固守范县","accounts":[{"id":"chengguo-a-796dedf5110f76a24dd2","label":"正文","text":"程昱说靳允固守范县","evidence":["chengguo-q-5dee0d49e84f5ba8f48e"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0101","role":"劝靳允固范","evidence":["chengguo-q-5dee0d49e84f5ba8f48e"]},{"person":"chengguo-p0049","role":"流涕允诺固守","evidence":["chengguo-q-5dee0d49e84f5ba8f48e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文","precision":"undated","basis":"拆分行动分别核对；无本条直接释年，不承袭复合候选公元年。","evidence":["chengguo-q-5dee0d49e84f5ba8f48e"]},"ordering_evidence":"chengguo-q-5dee0d49e84f5ba8f48e","source_order":[14,15,60],"order":2962},{"id":"chengguo-e-o081b","title":"靳允伏兵刺杀氾嶷并守范","accounts":[{"id":"chengguo-a-a0dd616c163a62d517fd","label":"正文","text":"靳允伏兵刺杀氾嶷并守范","evidence":["chengguo-q-5e3f979b821b1cae1c0b"]}],"participants":[{"person":"chengguo-p0049","role":"伏兵刺杀氾嶷勒兵守范","evidence":["chengguo-q-5e3f979b821b1cae1c0b"]},{"person":"chengguo-p0022","role":"被刺杀","evidence":["chengguo-q-5e3f979b821b1cae1c0b"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文","precision":"undated","basis":"拆分行动分别核对；无本条直接释年，不承袭复合候选公元年。","evidence":["chengguo-q-5e3f979b821b1cae1c0b"]},"ordering_evidence":"chengguo-q-5e3f979b821b1cae1c0b","source_order":[14,15,296],"order":2963},{"id":"chengguo-e-p131","title":"徐众评允宜先救至亲","accounts":[{"id":"chengguo-a-4bb73ae108b003192292","label":"裴注·徐众《评》","text":"徐众评允宜先救至亲","evidence":["chengguo-q-9e839c0be438527f4f68"]}],"participants":[{"person":"hequan-p0028","role":"评允于曹公未成君臣、母至亲也于义应去、允宜先救至亲、曹公亦宜遣允","evidence":["chengguo-q-9e839c0be438527f4f68"]},{"person":"chengguo-p0049","role":"被评者","evidence":["chengguo-q-9e839c0be438527f4f68"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["chengguo-q-9e839c0be438527f4f68"]},"ordering_evidence":"chengguo-q-9e839c0be438527f4f68","source_order":[14,29,11],"order":2967}],"persons":[{"id":"chengguo-p0049","name":"靳允","evidence":["chengguo-q-5dee0d49e84f5ba8f48e","chengguo-q-5e3f979b821b1cae1c0b","chengguo-q-9e839c0be438527f4f68"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-5dee0d49e84f5ba8f48e","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-ef6e6d390c285fe0d80e","layer":"original","quote":"昱乃归，过范，说其令靳允曰：“闻吕布执君母、弟、妻、子，孝子诚不可为心〖3〗！今天下大乱，英雄并起，必有命世能息天下之乱者〖4〗。此智者所详择也。得主者昌，失主者亡。陈宫叛迎吕布而百城皆应，似能有为；然以君观之，布何如人哉？夫布，粗中少亲〖5〗，刚而无礼，匹夫之雄耳！宫等以势假合，不能相君也〖6〗。兵虽众，终必无成。曹使君，智略不世出〖7〗，殆天所授。君必固范〖8〗，我守东阿，则田单之功可立也〖9〗。孰与违忠从恶，而母子俱亡乎？唯君详虑之！”允流涕曰：“不敢有二心！”","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":14,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":60,"end":296,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chengguo-q-5e3f979b821b1cae1c0b","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-ef6e6d390c285fe0d80e","layer":"original","quote":"时，氾嶷已在县。允乃见嶷，伏兵刺杀之，归，勒兵守","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":14,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":296,"end":320,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chengguo-q-9e839c0be438527f4f68","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-fe8b3016f0fea6efad57","layer":"pei","quote":"允于曹公，未成君臣；母，至亲也，于义应去。昔王陵母为项羽所拘，母以高祖必得天下，因自杀，以固陵志。明心无所系，然后可得成事人尽死之节。卫公子开方，仕齐，积年不归。管仲以为不怀其亲，安能爱君，不可以为相。是以求忠臣必于孝子之门。允宜先救至亲。徐庶母为曹公所得，刘备乃遣庶归：欲为天下者，恕人子之情也。曹公亦宜遣允","attribution":"裴注·徐众《评》","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":28,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-edaf45fc6ef4dcd2d302","start":11,"end":166,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
